 לעבוד מכל מקום. עוד כמה פרטים, והוא כבר מתחיל.',\n    dlPrompt: 'צריך את טלגרם? הורד בדקה:',\n    dlMobile: 'הורדת טלגרם לנייד ←', dlDesktop: 'הורדת טלגרם למחשב ←',\n    tgConsent: 'הורדתי טלגרם, אפשר להתחיל',\n    firstL: 'שם פרטי', firstPh: 'השם שלך', firstE: 'נא להזין שם פרטי',\n    lastL: 'שם משפחה', lastPh: 'שם משפחה', lastE: 'נא להזין שם משפחה',\n    emailL: 'אימייל', emailE: 'נא להזין אימייל תקין',\n    phoneL: 'טלפון', phoneE: 'נא להזין מספר טלפון תקין',\n    consent: 'קראתי ואישרתי את <a href=\"#\" onclick=\"return false\">מדיניות הפרטיות ותנאי השימוש</a>',\n    doneTitle: 'הסוכן שלך מחכה בטלגרם',\n    doneTitleName: '{name}, הסוכן שלך מחכה בטלגרם',\n    doneLead: 'הוא כבר כתב לך הודעה ראשונה. לחיצה אחת, ואתם מתחילים.',\n    rescueQ: 'לא הגיע קישור? עדיין אין טלגרם?', rescueA: 'חזרה לשלבי ההתקנה',\n    swipeHint: 'החליקו לראות אותו בפעולה',\n    submitting: 'מקימים לך סוכן...',\n    cta: [\n      { label:'קדימה, הסוכן שלך מחכה', action:'next', hint:true },\n      { label:'ורגע, כמה זה בטוח?', action:'next' },\n      { label:'נשמע בטוח, אפשר להתקדם', action:'next' },\n      { label:'יאללה, מתקינים', action:'next' },\n      { label:'פתחו לי סוכן', action:'submit', foot:'הפרטים נשמרים אצלך בלבד. בלי ספאם.' },\n    ],\n    demoGreeting: \"היי, אני ג'וני, הסוכן האישי שלך. ככה נראה יום עבודה איתי.\",\n    demoClosing: 'וזה רק על קצה המזלג. בפנים נדבר כבר על העבודה שלך.'\n  },\n  en: {\n    docTitle: 'NanoShellano · Your personal agent',\n    backAria: 'Back',\n    heroH1: 'A new employee just joined<br><span class=\"accent\">Your AI agent starts today</span>',\n    heroLead: \"Everyone keeps saying AI will change the world of work. It is already changing it, and agents entering every role will be seismic. We are here to teach you how to manage agents, with zero technical background, so you stay ahead of everyone.\",\n    trust: 'Free to try<span class=\"sep\">·</span>One tap from your phone<span class=\"sep\">·</span>Fully secured',\n    manifesto: 'Agents are entering every role. <b>Those who know how to manage them will lead.</b>',\n    demoH1: 'How a workday looks with <span class=\"accent\">your agent</span>',\n    demoLead: \"4 examples of routine tasks your agent handles once it's connected to your org's systems.\",\n    demoNote: \"Illustration only. The system connections aren't live yet.\",\n    tgName: 'Joni',\n    secH1: 'The Promise <span class=\"accent\">& Privacy</span>',\n    secLead: \"Your agent is closed and secure. 4 things worth knowing.\",\n    sec1T: 'An isolated environment, yours alone', sec1B: 'The agent runs in a closed environment that opens only for you. No outside party touches the data inside it.',\n    sec2T: 'Telegram, a private encrypted channel', sec2B: 'The whole conversation runs through Telegram only, encrypted and separate from your email, drive and every other system.',\n    sec3T: 'No access to your accounts', sec3B: 'Email, drive and accounts are blocked for the agent. A permanent architectural choice, not a temporary limitation.',\n    sec4T: 'External AI tools, on your keys', sec4B: 'External tools connect only through your own API keys. Closed, non-transferable, and disconnected with one click.',\n    sec5T: 'Full deletion, any time', sec5B: 'You can delete the entire chat history and fully shut the agent down with a single click, leaving nothing behind.',\n    soul: 'The mind of AI, the body of NanoClaw, and the soul of <span class=\"accent\">Elia Ben Cnaan</span>.',\n    pilH1: 'Ten days <span class=\"accent\">in the new world</span>',\n    pilLead: 'The world of work is changing before our eyes, and I want you to feel it for yourselves.',\n    pil1T: 'Completely free', pil1B: 'Ten days on me, from my own resources, so you can simply try it.',\n    pil2T: 'Enough time to get to know it', pil2B: 'Ten days is exactly the time to get used to the agent and see how it changes your day.',\n    pil3T: 'And from there, yours', pil3B: 'Once you feel the difference, you set up your own agent and carry on.',\n    pilSoul: 'Yours, <span class=\"accent\">Elia Ben Cnaan</span>.',\n    installH1: 'How it is going to work',\n    installLead: 'Four steps, from the moment you click until your agent is working for you.',\n    st1T: 'Telegram, your private channel', st1B: 'Available as a mobile app, a desktop app, and in the browser. Fast, synced, and comfortable for work. Already have it? Skip to the next step.',\n    dlMobile: 'Download for mobile →', dlDesktop: 'Download for desktop →',\n    st2T: 'We open your personal account', st2B: 'Name, phone and email. They open an account that is yours alone, and no one else gets in, not even us.',\n    st3T: 'Your agent is built automatically', st3B: 'The moment you approve, an automatic setup of your personal agent begins. A minute or two, and we make sure everything is ready and tuned just for you.',\n    st4T: 'The first conversation, on Telegram', st4B: 'The agent opens in your Telegram, introduces itself, and from there it is just a conversation.',\n    pilotH1: \"Preparing for the new world of work\",\n    pilotLead: \"I'm offering you a hands-on experience with an AI agent — free, for ten days.\",\n    pl1T: \"What exactly is this pilot?\", pl1B: \"You'll work with an AI agent for your role — no system connections needed. Joni starts working with you right from the conversation.\",\n    pl2T: \"Why am I doing this?\", pl2B: \"Because I believe that those who experience this now will be ready for what's coming. I gave you my resources so you can feel the difference for yourselves.\",\n    pl3T: \"After ten days?\", pl3B: \"The pilot runs for ten days, on my account. Those who want to continue — I've prepared a guide to set up your own NanoClaw, which connects to all your systems.\",\n    pilotCloser: \"We're here to get you ready.\",\n    formH1: 'Setting up your <span class=\"accent\">agent</span>',\n    formLead: 'Your agent lives in Telegram — a secure channel, on mobile and desktop.',\n    dlMobile: 'Download Telegram for mobile →', dlDesktop: 'Download Telegram for desktop →',\n    tgConsent: 'I have Telegram and I am ready to start',\n    firstL: 'First name', firstPh: 'Your first name', firstE: 'Please enter your first name',\n    lastL: 'Last name', lastPh: 'Last name', lastE: 'Please enter your last name',\n    emailL: 'Email', emailE: 'Please enter a valid email',\n    phoneL: 'Phone', phoneE: 'Please enter a valid phone number',\n    consent: 'I have read and accepted the <a href=\"#\" onclick=\"return false\">Privacy Policy and Terms of Use</a>',\n    doneTitle: 'Your agent is waiting on Telegram',\n    doneTitleName: '{name}, your agent is waiting on Telegram',\n    doneLead: 'It already sent you a first message. One tap, and you are off.',\n    rescueQ: \"Didn't get the link? No Telegram yet?\", rescueA: 'Back to the setup steps',\n    swipeHint: 'Swipe to see it in action',\n    submitting: 'Setting up your agent...',\n    cta: [\n      { label:'Come meet your agent', action:'next', hint:true },","numLines":100,"startLine":500,"totalLines":1065}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2b73dfc6-178b-47ba-aed0-55c18014f9e5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent","sessionId":"dc39f4ea-4c2e-4060-999c-ca445e3c19d4","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"pure-plotting-melody"}
